        "data": {
          "comment": "# Turn Research Notes into a Comparison Table\n\nTurns messy research notes into a Markdown table with one row per option. Cells the notes do not cover are marked unknown instead of guessed.\n\n**How it works:** Paste the notes into \"1 Input\". \"2 Agent\" picks the attributes the notes discuss as columns and writes one row per option, and \"3 Output\" returns the table.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"2 Agent\" and paste notes comparing three tools, then check which cells come back unknown."
